# AGENTS OS Phase 5D M0-D Actual Object-Only Source Run Decision Package v0.1

Date: 2026-07-25
Owner: Jenn
Agent steward: Nobao
Status: DRAFT_FOR_FRESH_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW
Terminal outcome: NOT_EXECUTED

## 1. Purpose and non-transition rule

This is a new, standalone decision package for one possible later
object-database-only source run. It is intentionally not the earlier
materialization preflight: it creates no worktree, performs no checkout, and
creates no quarantine payload.

Creating, reading, validating, or independently reviewing this package does not
run a Git command against VCPToolBox. It does not grant any execution authority.
Only a later current Jenn decision using Section 6 A, after the review gate in
Section 5 has passed, may authorize the bounded run described here.

The run, if separately authorized, may prove only that the sealed commit exists,
its tree matches, the exact seven non-protected tuples still resolve, and the
expected protected-name inventory remains excluded from any blob read. Its
success is evidence only. It cannot authorize a worktree, a plugin, a Host
lifecycle call, a runtime, or an actual Host smoke.

